<h1>Statistics &amp; the Art of <em>Not Fooling Yourself</em></h1>
<p class="sub">Given enough defensible choices, many datasets contain a path to <em>p</em>&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;.05. The whole discipline is the struggle not to walk it by accident.</p>

